{"seq":1,"slug":"wasi-fundamentals","title":"WASI 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/wasi-and-beyond/wasi-fundamentals","wordCount":980,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"wasi-基础\">WASI 基础</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>WASM 本身没有系统调用能力，出了浏览器就无从读写文件、取时间或生成随机数——<strong>WASI（WebAssembly System Interface）就是补齐这一层的标准化系统接口</strong>。它的设计遵循<strong>基于能力的安全模型</strong>：默认零权限，模块只能访问宿主通过<strong>预打开目录</strong>显式授权的路径，从而从根本上消除路径遍历等隐患。借助 WASI，Rust 程序用标准 <code>std</code> API 就能同一份代码编译为原生和 WASM 两种目标，而时钟与随机数这类能力由运行时决定其是否可控、是否确定。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"wasi-概述\">WASI 概述</h2><p>WASI（WebAssembly System Interface）为 WASM 模块提供了与操作系统交互的标准化接口，将 WASM 的沙箱安全模型从浏览器扩展到服务端和边缘计算领域。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    WASM_MODULE[&quot;WASM 模块&quot;] --&gt; WASI[&quot;WASI 接口层&quot;]&#10;    WASI --&gt; FS[&quot;文件系统&quot;]&#10;    WASI --&gt; CLOCK[&quot;时钟&quot;]&#10;    WASI --&gt; RANDOM[&quot;随机数&quot;]&#10;    WASI --&gt; ENV[&quot;环境变量&quot;]&#10;    WASI --&gt; STDIO[&quot;标准输入/输出&quot;]&#10;    WASI --&gt; NET[&quot;网络 (Preview 2)&quot;]\">graph TD\n    WASM_MODULE[\"WASM 模块\"] --&gt; WASI[\"WASI 接口层\"]\n    WASI --&gt; FS[\"文件系统\"]\n    WASI --&gt; CLOCK[\"时钟\"]\n    WASI --&gt; RANDOM[\"随机数\"]\n    WASI --&gt; ENV[\"环境变量\"]\n    WASI --&gt; STDIO[\"标准输入/输出\"]\n    WASI --&gt; NET[\"网络 (Preview 2)\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>WASI 版本</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>主要特性</th>\n<th>接口风格</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Preview 1</td>\n<td>稳定</td>\n<td>文件/时钟/随机数/环境变量</td>\n<td>POSIX 风格函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Preview 2</td>\n<td>开发中</td>\n<td>组件模型 + 新 API</td>\n<td>WIT 接口定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Preview 3</td>\n<td>规划中</td>\n<td>异步 I/O + 更多功能</td>\n<td>WIT 接口定义</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::fs;&#10;use std::io::{self, Read, Write};&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    println!(&quot;WASI 程序启动&quot;);&#10;&#10;    if let Ok(entries) = fs::read_dir(&quot;/data&quot;) {&#10;        for entry in entries.flatten() {&#10;            println!(&quot;文件: {:?}&quot;, entry.path());&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if let Ok(content) = fs::read_to_string(&quot;/data/config.toml&quot;) {&#10;        println!(&quot;配置内容: {}&quot;, content);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    let args: Vec&lt;String&gt; = std::env::args().collect();&#10;    println!(&quot;命令行参数: {:?}&quot;, args);&#10;&#10;    for (key, value) in std::env::vars() {&#10;        println!(&quot;环境变量: {}={}&quot;, key, value);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::fs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::io::{self, Read, Write};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"WASI 程序启动\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if let Ok(entries) = fs::read_dir(\"/data\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for entry in entries.flatten() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println!(\"文件: {:?}\", entry.path());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if let Ok(content) = fs::read_to_string(\"/data/config.toml\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"配置内容: {}\", content);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let args: Vec&#x3C;String> = std::env::args().collect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"命令行参数: {:?}\", args);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (key, value) in std::env::vars() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"环境变量: {}={}\", key, value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> WASI 程序使用标准的 Rust <code>std</code> 库 API（如 <code>fs::read_to_string</code>），但底层实现由 WASI 运行时提供。同一份 Rust 代码可以编译为原生二进制或 WASM+WASI 目标，实现跨平台一致性。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"文件系统访问\">文件系统访问</h2><p>WASI 的文件系统访问基于**预打开目录（Pre-opened Directories）**机制，模块只能访问宿主显式授权的目录。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 使用 Wasmtime 运行，授予 /data 目录访问权&#10;wasmtime run --dir /data::/host/data my_program.wasm&#10;&#10;# 多个目录映射&#10;wasmtime run \\&#10;  --dir /input::/host/input \\&#10;  --dir /output::/host/output \\&#10;  my_program.wasm\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 Wasmtime 运行，授予 /data 目录访问权</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasmtime</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --dir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /data::/host/data</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my_program.wasm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 多个目录映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasmtime</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --dir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /input::/host/input</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --dir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /output::/host/output</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  my_program.wasm</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::fs;&#10;use std::path::Path;&#10;&#10;fn process_files() -&gt; io::Result&lt;()&gt; {&#10;    let input_dir = Path::new(&quot;/input&quot;);&#10;    let output_dir = Path::new(&quot;/output&quot;);&#10;&#10;    for entry in fs::read_dir(input_dir)? {&#10;        let entry = entry?;&#10;        let content = fs::read_to_string(entry.path())?;&#10;        let processed = content.to_uppercase();&#10;        let output_path = output_dir.join(entry.file_name());&#10;        fs::write(output_path, processed)?;&#10;    }&#10;    Ok(())&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::fs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::path::Path;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn process_files() -> io::Result&#x3C;()> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let input_dir = Path::new(\"/input\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let output_dir = Path::new(\"/output\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for entry in fs::read_dir(input_dir)? {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let entry = entry?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let content = fs::read_to_string(entry.path())?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let processed = content.to_uppercase();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let output_path = output_dir.join(entry.file_name());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fs::write(output_path, processed)?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>WASI 文件操作</th>\n<th>对应 POSIX</th>\n<th>Rust std API</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>path_open</code></td>\n<td><code>open()</code></td>\n<td><code>File::open()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fd_read</code></td>\n<td><code>read()</code></td>\n<td><code>file.read()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fd_write</code></td>\n<td><code>write()</code></td>\n<td><code>file.write()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fd_seek</code></td>\n<td><code>lseek()</code></td>\n<td><code>file.seek()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>path_readlink</code></td>\n<td><code>readlink()</code></td>\n<td><code>fs::read_link()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>path_create_directory</code></td>\n<td><code>mkdir()</code></td>\n<td><code>fs::create_dir()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>path_unlink_file</code></td>\n<td><code>unlink()</code></td>\n<td><code>fs::remove_file()</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    MODULE[&quot;WASM 模块&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;path_open(/data/file.txt)&quot;| WASI_LAYER[&quot;WASI 运行时层&quot;]&#10;    WASI_LAYER --&gt;|&quot;检查预打开权限&quot;| CHECK{授权检查}&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|&quot;已授权&quot;| HOST_FS[&quot;宿主文件系统&quot;]&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|&quot;未授权&quot;| DENY[&quot;ENOTCAPABLE 错误&quot;]&#10;    HOST_FS --&gt; FILE[&quot;读取文件内容&quot;]&#10;    FILE --&gt; MODULE\">graph TD\n    MODULE[\"WASM 模块\"] --&gt;|\"path_open(/data/file.txt)\"| WASI_LAYER[\"WASI 运行时层\"]\n    WASI_LAYER --&gt;|\"检查预打开权限\"| CHECK{授权检查}\n    CHECK --&gt;|\"已授权\"| HOST_FS[\"宿主文件系统\"]\n    CHECK --&gt;|\"未授权\"| DENY[\"ENOTCAPABLE 错误\"]\n    HOST_FS --&gt; FILE[\"读取文件内容\"]\n    FILE --&gt; MODULE</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"时钟与随机数\">时钟与随机数</h2><p>WASI 提供确定性和非确定性两类系统服务，时钟和随机数是最常用的。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::time::{Instant, SystemTime, UNIX_EPOCH};&#10;&#10;fn timing_example() {&#10;    let start = Instant::now();&#10;&#10;    let mut sum = 0u64;&#10;    for i in 0..1_000_000 {&#10;        sum += i;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    let elapsed = start.elapsed();&#10;    println!(&quot;计算耗时: {:?}&quot;, elapsed);&#10;&#10;    let timestamp = SystemTime::now()&#10;        .duration_since(UNIX_EPOCH)&#10;        .unwrap()&#10;        .as_millis();&#10;    println!(&quot;当前时间戳: {}&quot;, timestamp);&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn random_example() {&#10;    let mut buf = [0u8; 32];&#10;    getrandom::getrandom(&amp;mut buf).unwrap();&#10;    println!(&quot;随机字节: {:?}&quot;, &amp;buf[..8]);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::time::{Instant, SystemTime, UNIX_EPOCH};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn timing_example() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let start = Instant::now();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut sum = 0u64;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in 0..1_000_000 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        sum += i;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let elapsed = start.elapsed();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"计算耗时: {:?}\", elapsed);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let timestamp = SystemTime::now()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .duration_since(UNIX_EPOCH)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .unwrap()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .as_millis();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"当前时间戳: {}\", timestamp);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn random_example() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut buf = [0u8; 32];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    getrandom::getrandom(&#x26;mut buf).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"随机字节: {:?}\", &#x26;buf[..8]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>WASI 时钟/随机 API</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>确定性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>clock_time_get</code> (realtime)</td>\n<td>墙钟时间</td>\n<td>非确定性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>clock_time_get</code> (monotonic)</td>\n<td>单调时钟</td>\n<td>非确定性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>clock_res_get</code></td>\n<td>时钟精度</td>\n<td>运行时相关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>random_get</code></td>\n<td>加密安全随机数</td>\n<td>非确定性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 某些 WASI 运行时（如用于区块链的运行时）会故意返回固定的时钟值和随机数，以保证执行的确定性。如果你的程序依赖随机性，需要确认目标运行时的行为。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"环境变量与命令行参数\">环境变量与命令行参数</h2><p>WASI 程序可以像传统命令行程序一样接收环境变量和命令行参数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 传递环境变量和参数&#10;wasmtime run \\&#10;  --env API_KEY=secret123 \\&#10;  --env LOG_LEVEL=debug \\&#10;  my_program.wasm -- --input data.csv --output result.json\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 传递环境变量和参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasmtime</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --env</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> API_KEY=secret123</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --env</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> LOG_LEVEL=debug</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  my_program.wasm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --input</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> data.csv</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --output</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> result.json</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::env;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let args: Vec&lt;String&gt; = env::args().collect();&#10;    println!(&quot;程序名: {}&quot;, args[0]);&#10;    println!(&quot;参数: {:?}&quot;, &amp;args[1..]);&#10;&#10;    match env::var(&quot;LOG_LEVEL&quot;) {&#10;        Ok(level) =&gt; println!(&quot;日志级别: {}&quot;, level),&#10;        Err(_) =&gt; println!(&quot;未设置日志级别，使用默认值&quot;),&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    let config = AppConfig {&#10;        api_key: env::var(&quot;API_KEY&quot;).unwrap_or_default(),&#10;        log_level: env::var(&quot;LOG_LEVEL&quot;).unwrap_or_else(|_| &quot;info&quot;.to_string()),&#10;        input: args.get(1).cloned().unwrap_or_default(),&#10;    };&#10;&#10;    println!(&quot;配置: {:?}&quot;, config);&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[derive(Debug)]&#10;struct AppConfig {&#10;    api_key: String,&#10;    log_level: String,&#10;    input: String,&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::env;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let args: Vec&#x3C;String> = env::args().collect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"程序名: {}\", args[0]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"参数: {:?}\", &#x26;args[1..]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match env::var(\"LOG_LEVEL\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(level) => println!(\"日志级别: {}\", level),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Err(_) => println!(\"未设置日志级别，使用默认值\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let config = AppConfig {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        api_key: env::var(\"API_KEY\").unwrap_or_default(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        log_level: env::var(\"LOG_LEVEL\").unwrap_or_else(|_| \"info\".to_string()),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        input: args.get(1).cloned().unwrap_or_default(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"配置: {:?}\", config);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(Debug)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct AppConfig {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    api_key: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    log_level: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>WASI 参数 API</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>Rust std 对应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>args_sizes_get</code></td>\n<td>获取参数数量和总大小</td>\n<td>内部使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>args_get</code></td>\n<td>读取参数字符串</td>\n<td><code>std::env::args()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>environ_sizes_get</code></td>\n<td>获取环境变量数量</td>\n<td>内部使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>environ_get</code></td>\n<td>读取环境变量</td>\n<td><code>std::env::var()</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"基于能力的安全模型\">基于能力的安全模型</h2><p>WASI 采用**基于能力（Capability-based）**的安全模型，与传统的基于身份（ACL）模型有本质区别。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 传统 ACL 模型&#10;        PROC1[&quot;进程&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;open(/etc/passwd)&quot;| KERNEL1[&quot;内核&quot;]&#10;        KERNEL1 --&gt;|&quot;检查 UID/权限位&quot;| FS1[&quot;文件系统&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph WASI 能力模型&#10;        WASM1[&quot;WASM 模块&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;fd_read(fd3)&quot;| RUNTIME[&quot;WASI 运行时&quot;]&#10;        RUNTIME --&gt;|&quot;fd3 → /data (只读)&quot;| FS2[&quot;映射的目录&quot;]&#10;        WASM1 -.-x|&quot;无法访问&quot;| OTHER[&quot;其他路径&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 传统 ACL 模型\n        PROC1[\"进程\"] --&gt;|\"open(/etc/passwd)\"| KERNEL1[\"内核\"]\n        KERNEL1 --&gt;|\"检查 UID/权限位\"| FS1[\"文件系统\"]\n    end\n    subgraph WASI 能力模型\n        WASM1[\"WASM 模块\"] --&gt;|\"fd_read(fd3)\"| RUNTIME[\"WASI 运行时\"]\n        RUNTIME --&gt;|\"fd3 → /data (只读)\"| FS2[\"映射的目录\"]\n        WASM1 -.-x|\"无法访问\"| OTHER[\"其他路径\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>ACL（传统）</th>\n<th>Capability（WASI）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>权限粒度</td>\n<td>用户/组级别</td>\n<td>文件描述符级别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>授权时机</td>\n<td>运行时内核检查</td>\n<td>启动时宿主授予</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境逃逸</td>\n<td>可能（如路径遍历）</td>\n<td>不可能（无 ambient 权限）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>默认权限</td>\n<td>继承用户所有权限</td>\n<td>零权限（最小特权）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权限传递</td>\n<td>fork 继承</td>\n<td>显式传递文件描述符</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 最小权限原则示例&#10;# 只读访问输入，只写访问输出&#10;wasmtime run \\&#10;  --dir /input::/host/input:readonly \\&#10;  --dir /output::/host/output \\&#10;  my_program.wasm&#10;&#10;# 完全隔离运行（无文件系统访问）&#10;wasmtime run my_program.wasm&#10;&#10;# 仅允许标准输入输出&#10;wasmtime run --inherit-stdio my_program.wasm\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 最小权限原则示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 只读访问输入，只写访问输出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasmtime</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --dir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /input::/host/input:readonly</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --dir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /output::/host/output</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  my_program.wasm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 完全隔离运行（无文件系统访问）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasmtime</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my_program.wasm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 仅允许标准输入输出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasmtime</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --inherit-stdio</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my_program.wasm</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> WASI 的安全模型遵循&quot;默认拒绝&quot;原则——如果你不显式授予文件系统访问权限，WASM 模块连 <code>/tmp</code> 都无法访问。这与 Docker 容器的&quot;默认允许&quot;策略形成鲜明对比，安全性更强。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((WASI 基础))&#10;    概述&#10;      系统接口标准&#10;      Preview 1/2/3&#10;      从浏览器到服务端&#10;    文件系统&#10;      预打开目录&#10;      显式授权&#10;      POSIX 风格 API&#10;    时钟与随机&#10;      墙钟/单调时钟&#10;      加密随机数&#10;      运行时可控确定性&#10;    环境变量&#10;      args/environ&#10;      运行时传递&#10;      标准 Rust API&#10;    能力安全模型&#10;      默认拒绝&#10;      文件描述符粒度&#10;      无 ambient 权限\">mindmap\n  root((WASI 基础))\n    概述\n      系统接口标准\n      Preview 1/2/3\n      从浏览器到服务端\n    文件系统\n      预打开目录\n      显式授权\n      POSIX 风格 API\n    时钟与随机\n      墙钟/单调时钟\n      加密随机数\n      运行时可控确定性\n    环境变量\n      args/environ\n      运行时传递\n      标准 Rust API\n    能力安全模型\n      默认拒绝\n      文件描述符粒度\n      无 ambient 权限</pre><ul>\n<li>WASI 为 WASM 提供了<strong>标准化的系统接口</strong>，覆盖文件系统、时钟、随机数和环境变量。</li>\n<li>文件系统访问基于<strong>预打开目录</strong>机制，模块只能访问宿主显式授权的路径。</li>\n<li>时钟和随机数通过 WASI API 提供，某些运行时可以控制其确定性行为。</li>\n<li>WASI 程序使用标准 Rust <code>std</code> API，同一份代码可编译为原生和 WASM 两种目标。</li>\n<li><strong>基于能力的安全模型</strong>遵循最小特权原则，默认零权限，从根本上消除了路径遍历等安全隐患。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"WASI 基础","id":"wasi-基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"WASI 概述","id":"wasi-概述"},{"level":2,"text":"文件系统访问","id":"文件系统访问"},{"level":2,"text":"时钟与随机数","id":"时钟与随机数"},{"level":2,"text":"环境变量与命令行参数","id":"环境变量与命令行参数"},{"level":2,"text":"基于能力的安全模型","id":"基于能力的安全模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Web Workers 与 WASM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/typescript-integration/web-workers-and-wasm"},"next":{"title":"组件模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/wasi-and-beyond/component-model"}}